config QTI_MHI_NETDEV
	tristate "MHI Net support for the MHI client"
	depends on QTI_MHI_BUS
	help
	  This is a client for MHI Transport.
	  The MHI-based network device driver facilitates IP traffic transfer
	  between the host and modem. Enabling this driver allows clients
	  to use a standard network interface for data transfer,
	  with over-the-air traffic managed through the MHI netdev interface.
